@70149 = ~Conjure Lesser Fire Elemental
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 5
Range: 20 ft.
Duration: 1 turn/level (maximum 20 turns)
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The caster summons an 8-Hit-Dice fire elemental. The elemental contests the caster's control for 3 rounds; there is a 15% chance that it becomes hostile when the contest ends.~
